<title>FINLAND: Finnish Jan wholesale prices rise 0.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Jan wholesale prices rise 0.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish wholesale price index rose 0.4 percent in January on December and it rose 0.6 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>			     Jan 1997     Dec 1996    Jan 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth		    +0.4 pct     +0.3 pct    +0.7 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr			+0.6 pct     +0.9 pct    +0.6 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
